# `GENRE-NODE-SPELLING`: `state` and `transition` are the statechart vocabulary.
# `state` is `node` renamed for this genre — same option keys, same id space,
# same `shape=box` default, `role` still absent (a statechart has exactly one
# kind of node, so there is no role to state). `transition` is the connector.
figdown 0.2 statechart
title "Turnstile"
class mode "A mode of the mechanism" fill=#e0e7ff
state locked "LOCKED" class=mode
state unlocked "UNLOCKED" class=mode
transition locked -[coin]-> unlocked
transition unlocked -[push]-> locked
transition locked -[push]-> locked
rank locked,unlocked
flow right
